    "preamble": "109/1998 on 17 August, 2015",
    "facts": "The record shows that this is an appeal against acquittal as against the judgment dated 31st May 1997 passed by the Senior Municipal Magistrate, Calcutta in Case No. 30-D of 1988 under section 16(1) a(i) read with section 7 of Prevention of Food Adulteration Act, 1954 in which the said learned trial court was pleased to acquit all the three accused persons being the proprietor, person- in-charge and seller. The complainant was Dr. S.K. Basu, Food Inspector of the then Calcutta Municipal Corporation (as it was called then).",
